<title>UK: LME copper drifts lower in late trading.</title>
<headline>LME copper drifts lower in late trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ME copper eased in late inter-office trading on Wednesday, continuing its move to the bottom of its recent range.</p>
<p>Shortly after 1900 GMT, three months copper was indicated at $2,340/44, down from a kerb close of $2,352.</p>
<p>Next support was pegged at recent lows of $2,322 and $2,305.</p>
<p>Zinc was also indicated weaker at $1,280/84 versus a kerb close of $1,289.</p>
<p>The others were little changed.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542-8065</p>
